### ==========================================
### hr_duty_summary 考勤汇总 CRUD 测试
### 路由前缀: /duty/hr-duty
### ==========================================

### ---- 查询 ----

### 查询所有考勤汇总记录
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list

### 按用户ID查询
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list?userId=1

### 按用户名模糊查询
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list?username=张

### 按日期范围查询
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 按单个日期查询
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list?duty_date=2026-07-19

### 按用户ID+日期范围组合查询
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/list?userId=1&startDate=2026-07-01&endDate=2026-07-31

### 根据ID查询单条记录
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/1

### ---- 创建 ----

### 创建单条考勤汇总记录
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "username": "张三",
    "duty_date": "2026-07-19",
    "value": "1"
}

### 创建记录(value为空)
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 2,
    "username": "李四",
    "duty_date": "2026-07-19",
    "value": ""
}

### 创建记录(value为特殊字符)
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 3,
    "username": "王五",
    "duty_date": "2026-07-19",
    "value": "●"
}

### 批量创建考勤汇总记录
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "records": [
        { "userId": 1, "username": "张三", "duty_date": "2026-07-01", "value": "1" },
        { "userId": 1, "username": "张三", "duty_date": "2026-07-02", "value": "2" },
        { "userId": 1, "username": "张三", "duty_date": "2026-07-03", "value": "C" },
        { "userId": 2, "username": "李四", "duty_date": "2026-07-01", "value": "S" },
        { "userId": 2, "username": "李四", "duty_date": "2026-07-02", "value": "B" }
    ]
}

### ---- 更新 ----

### 更新考勤值
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "value": "3"
}

### 更新用户名
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "张三丰"
}

### 更新日期
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "duty_date": "2026-07-20"
}

### ---- 删除 ----

### 删除单条记录
DELETE http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/1

### 删除不存在的记录(应返回404)
DELETE http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/9999

### ---- 错误场景测试 ----

### 缺少必填字段(应返回400)
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "测试"
}

### 重复创建同一用户同一日期(应返回409)
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "username": "张三",
    "duty_date": "2026-07-19",
    "value": "1"
}

### 查询不存在的记录(应返回404)
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/hr-duty/9999
